# Copy to frontend/.env and adjust. Never commit frontend/.env.
#
# Nothing is required here — the frontend build takes no configuration.
#
# VITE_DEMO_EMAIL / VITE_DEMO_PASSWORD used to live in this file, inlining a
# shared demo account's credentials into the client bundle. The server now
# mints a private demo account per visitor (POST /auth/demo), so there is no
# password to hand out and nothing to keep in step with the backend.
#
# To switch demo sign-in off, set DEMO_ENABLED=false on the BACKEND; the login
# page hides its button when the endpoint answers 404.
